# Gentian OS installer settings. No secrets here: credentials are asked for
# and kept in OpenBao.
#
#   cp install.env.template install.env    # edit, then ./install.sh
#
# This file says where the cluster's configuration comes from and how to run
# the install. What the cluster IS is asked on the first run and written to the
# Cluster claim in the deployments repository (see the end of this file).
# Every setting is explained in docs/install-reference.md §4.

# ── Set these before the first run ───────────────────────────────────────────

# Your deployments repository and its branch.
GENTIAN_DEPLOYMENTS_REPO=https://github.com/gentian-org/gentian-deployments
GENTIAN_DEPLOYMENTS_BRANCH=main

# This cluster's directory under clusters/ in that repository.
GENTIAN_DEPLOYMENTS_CLUSTER_ID=default-cluster

# dev, staging or prod. The repository needs profiles/<stage>.yaml.
GENTIAN_DEPLOYMENTS_STAGE=dev

# The gentian-os branch or release tag this checkout is on. The cluster follows it.
GENTIAN_OS_BRANCH=develop

# How the deployments repository authenticates: basic (user name and token,
# for a private repository), bearer, or none (a public one).
GENTIAN_DEPLOYMENTS_AUTH=basic

# The gentian-ui branch the cluster reads.
GENTIAN_UI_BRANCH=develop

# ── Optional: uncomment to change. The value shown is the default ────────────

# Local checkout of the deployments repository.
# GENTIAN_DEPLOYMENTS_PATH=${HOME}/.gentian/gentian-deployments

# Where the platform administrator's activation link is mailed, e.g.
# you@example.org. Unset, the handover asks, or shows the link once.
# CLUSTER_ADMIN_RECOVERY_EMAIL=

# Seconds the handover waits for the platform administrator's sign-in.
# GENTIAN_HANDOVER_WAIT_SECS=1800

# Seconds the install waits for the user tenant of a single-tenancy cluster.
# GENTIAN_USER_TENANT_WAIT_SECS=900

# 0 keeps the break-glass signing key out of the recovery kit.
# GENTIAN_KIT_INCLUDE_BREAK_GLASS=1

# 1 turns the daily licence report off (the App Store is then not offered),
# 0 turns it back on. Unset keeps what the cluster has; a new cluster reports.
# GENTIAN_NO_LICENCE_REPORT=

# Send the licence report to another https address.
# GENTIAN_LICENCE_REPORT_URL=

# true turns the kernel namespaces' NetworkPolicies on. Do it after a
# successful install, with ./install.sh --only A-01,B-01.
# KERNEL_NETWORK_POLICIES=false

# false turns the NetworkPolicies of the shared stores, mail and the model
# gateway off.
# STORE_NETWORK_POLICIES=true

# true installs every Crossplane provider resource type. Cannot be taken back.
# CROSSPLANE_ACTIVATE_ALL=false

# 1 keeps typed credentials out of the cache under ~/.gentian.
# GENTIAN_NO_CREDENTIAL_CACHE=0

# 1 hides secrets while they are typed.
# GENTIAN_MASK_SECRETS=0

# Where the two deployment signing keys live. Never your own keyring.
# GENTIAN_GPG_HOME=${HOME}/.gentian/gnupg

# Which bao to fetch when none is on PATH. Default: the pin in versions.yaml.
# OPENBAO_CLI_VERSION=

# ── Unattended install ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1 takes the default for every question. Then KERNEL_DOMAIN and
# GENTIAN_KIT_RECIPIENT are required, and the credentials come from the
# environment (GETTING-STARTED.md, "Installing unattended").
# GENTIAN_NONINTERACTIVE=0

# The cluster's domain, for the first unattended run only. Remove it afterwards.
# KERNEL_DOMAIN=platform.example.com

# An age public key to encrypt the recovery kit to, instead of a passphrase.
# GENTIAN_KIT_RECIPIENT=age1...

# ── A fork or a mirror ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# GENTIAN_OS_REPO=https://github.com/gentian-org/gentian-os
# GENTIAN_OS_AUTH=none
# GENTIAN_UI_REPO=https://github.com/gentian-org/gentian-ui
# GENTIAN_UI_AUTH=none

# The branch whose charts are installed for the desktop, the admin console,
# the sign-in page and the App Store.
# PORTAL_IMAGE_TAG=develop

# The default catalogue and the App Store API a new Cluster claim names.
# Default: by the gentian-os ref, and https://store-service.aluvian.io.
# GENTIAN_CATALOGUE_URL=
# GENTIAN_STORE_URL=

# ── Do not set these here ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# GENTIAN_OS_IMAGE_TAG      Unset, the cluster runs the build of this checkout's
#                           commit. A line left here pins an older build.
# GENTIAN_DEFAULT_PROFILES  Unset, the default profile comes from its catalogue.
#                           A local file or an http address stops the install.
# Any credential            Tokens and passwords are asked for, or exported for
#                           an unattended run. Never written to this file.
#
# Settings of the cluster belong on the Cluster claim
# (clusters/<cluster-id>/kernel/claims/cluster.yaml in the deployments
# repository). A value here overrides the claim on every run, and the installer
# warns about it. Change them in the claim and run ./install.sh:
#
#   TENANCY_MODE (spec.tenancyMode)      SECRET_MODE (spec.secretMode)
#   NETWORK_MODE, NODE_IP                STORAGE_CLASS, PLATFORM
#   MAIL_SERVICE_MODE (spec.mail)        DNS_PROVIDER, ACME_ENV, LETSENCRYPT_EMAIL
#   CERT_ISSUER_MODE (spec.certificates.issuerMode)
#   LLM_SUPPORT, GPU_ACCELERATION and the models (spec.llm)
#
# For an unattended first run, export them in the environment of that one run.
